1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:05,730
A robot can see a bottle cap without knowing whether its fingers grip securely.
看见瓶盖，不等于知道手指抓稳了。

2
00:00:06,230 --> 00:00:11,250
DeCAL asks how a vision-language-action model should use touch before choosing its next motion.
DeCAL研究VLA如何用触觉决定下一步。

3
00:00:11,920 --> 00:00:17,800
The paper tests wiping, assembly, twisting, pipetting, and screwing a light bulb.
论文测试擦拭、装配、拧盖、移液和拧灯泡。

4
00:00:18,240 --> 00:00:23,540
These tasks require coordinated arm movement and small finger adjustments under changing contact.
任务需要手臂与手指随接触变化协同调整。

5
00:00:24,165 --> 00:00:30,765
First, fingertip deformation maps become tactile tokens describing local and global contact.
首先，把指尖形变编码为局部和全局触觉特征。

6
00:00:31,125 --> 00:00:36,645
A contact-aware gate changes their contribution, rather than mixing every sensory input equally.
接触门控调节触觉权重，不把各种信号等量混合。

7
00:00:37,202 --> 00:00:43,222
Second, a generation expert predicts future visual and tactile representations together.
第二，生成专家联合预测未来视觉与触觉表征。

8
00:00:43,582 --> 00:00:48,542
Learning what contact should become supplies the action model with information about physical change.
学习接触如何变化，为动作模型提供物理线索。

9
00:00:49,152 --> 00:00:54,772
Third, factorized flow matching models arm and hand actions with separate noise streams.
第三，分解流匹配分别处理手臂和手指动作。

10
00:00:55,412 --> 00:01:01,212
The streams interact, preserving coordination while allowing fine finger motion to have distinct dynamics.
两路共同交互，兼顾协同与手指精细动态。

11
00:01:01,960 --> 00:01:07,840
The platform uses two UR5 arms and two twenty-two-degree-of-freedom SharpaWave hands.
平台使用双UR5和两只22自由度SharpaWave手。

12
00:01:08,300 --> 00:01:13,260
Each task has one hundred demonstrations and twenty evaluation trials for each method.
每项任务100条示教，每种方法评测20次。

13
00:01:13,884 --> 00:01:18,584
Across six tasks, complete success averages seventy point eight percent.
六项任务的完整成功率平均为70.8%。

14
00:01:18,924 --> 00:01:24,064
DECO reaches fifty-five point eight percent under the same protocol: a fifteen-point difference.
同协议DECO为55.8%，相差15个百分点。

15
00:01:24,649 --> 00:01:29,849
The reported progress score also credits completed stages of unfinished attempts.
进度得分也会计入未完成尝试中的成功阶段。

16
00:01:30,249 --> 00:01:35,689
Keep that separate from complete success; the light-bulb task still succeeds only forty percent.
要与完整成功分开；拧灯泡仍只有40%成功。

17
00:01:36,253 --> 00:01:43,753
DeCAL combines contact-dependent sensing, future physical representations, and coordinated action generation.
DeCAL结合接触门控、未来表征与协同动作生成。

18
00:01:44,313 --> 00:01:50,233
Its evidence comes from this instrumented platform and small task suite, not arbitrary household robots.
证据来自这套传感平台与任务集，泛化仍需检验。
